# Overrides testcontainers-java's bundled my.cnf (mysql-default-conf/ inside the
# org.testcontainers:mysql jar), which still sets innodb_log_file_size — removed in MySQL
# 8.0.30+ (renamed innodb_redo_log_capacity) and rejected as an unknown variable by mysql:9.4.0,
# so the container refuses to start. Wired in via MySQLContainer#withConfigurationOverride in
# MySqlContainerExtension.kt. No tuning needed for a throwaway test container — empty is enough.
[mysqld]
